    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "22 sides.",
      "worked": "Each larger exterior angle is $2\\times15^{\\circ}=30^{\\circ}$. Let $n$ be the number of sides.\n$$\\begin{align*}2(30)+15(n-2)&=360\\\\60+15(n-2)&=360\\\\15(n-2)&=300\\\\n-2&=20\\\\n&=22\\end{align*}$$\nThe polygon has 22 sides.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 35
